{#
  Reusable identity primitives (the master identity, which supersedes the
  Phase 1 text-only "no symbol" decision).

  The ALV symbol is the original Dark Precision drawing, geometry unchanged:
  a block raked 8deg, 78 wide x 88 tall on a 100 grid, split by a seam
  (y 57 to 63), with an upright A knocked out of it. The A has no crossbar of
  its own; the seam completes it. It takes its colour from `color`
  (currentColor) and its cut from the shared #alvCut mask in icon-sprite.njk.

  The wordmark is live text in Archivo (weight 640, normal width, -0.024em),
  the one place Archivo is used; everything else stays Bricolage + Instrument
  Sans. Neutral Screen Light ink only.

    symbol(cls)          the bare symbol (a decorative svg)
    mark(size, cls)      the compact mark: the symbol alone. Replaces the old
                         text-only "ALV".
    lockup(size, cls, attrs)
                         symbol + ALVSolutions, horizontal. `size` picks
                         alv-lockup--<size> (font-size drives everything: the
                         symbol is 1.667em, the gap 0.611em). `attrs` adds raw
                         attributes (data-wm marks the opening motion's hook).
    signature(size)      the italic "Built by ALVSolutions" signing treatment
                         used on work that carries someone else's name.
#}
{% macro symbol(cls="") %}<svg class="alv-symbol{% if cls %} {{ cls }}{% endif %}" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g fill="currentColor" mask="url(#alvCut)"><path d="M17.25 6 L95.25 6 L88.01 57 L10.01 57 Z"/><path d="M9.15 63 L87.15 63 L82.75 94 L4.75 94 Z"/></g></svg>{% endmacro %}

{% macro mark(size="m", cls="") %}<svg class="alv-symbol alv-mark alv-mark--{{ size }}{% if cls %} {{ cls }}{% endif %}" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g fill="currentColor" mask="url(#alvCut)"><path d="M17.25 6 L95.25 6 L88.01 57 L10.01 57 Z"/><path d="M9.15 63 L87.15 63 L82.75 94 L4.75 94 Z"/></g></svg>{% endmacro %}

{% macro lockup(size="nav", cls="", attrs="") %}<span class="alv-lockup alv-lockup--{{ size }}{% if cls %} {{ cls }}{% endif %}"{% if attrs %} {{ attrs | safe }}{% endif %}><svg class="alv-symbol alv-lockup-mark" viewBox="0 0 100 100" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g fill="currentColor" mask="url(#alvCut)"><path d="M17.25 6 L95.25 6 L88.01 57 L10.01 57 Z"/><path d="M9.15 63 L87.15 63 L82.75 94 L4.75 94 Z"/></g></svg><span class="alv-lockup-word">ALVSolutions</span></span>{% endmacro %}

{% macro signature(size="foot") %}<span class="alv-sign alv-sign--{{ size }}"><span class="alv-sign-line"><span class="alv-sign-by">Built by</span><span class="alv-sign-name">ALVSolutions</span></span></span>{% endmacro %}
